OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuations as crews tackle garage
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral properties have been evacuated
OL,7,Fas fire crews tackle a fire at a garage
OL,8,Fin Woodville.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for Derbyshire Police
OL,11,Fsaid High Street was shut between
OL,12,FHepworth Road and Clock roundabout due
OL,13,Fto the blaze.
OL,15,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,16,Ftwo fire crews from Swadlincote and two
OL,17,Fcrews from Leicestershire were in
OL,18,Fattendance.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
